MDL308, §3.2: from v0.19.3-1, the pre-processor turns the valueless flag
"routines" into "routines= 1": the same file that v0.19.1-x rejects
(mdl113-bare-flag-v0.19.1) loads, routines are dumped and users.email is
masked. The linter only notes the fragile form (info).
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.3-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL308, MDL405
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
expect routines-dumped: true
expect column app.users.email: masked
when kb:table-sections-ignored
# F17: this mydumper loses every table section (MDL511).
lint: MDL308, MDL405, MDL511
expect column app.users.email: plaintext
end
-- defaults.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql
user=e2e
password=e2e-password

[mydumper]
routines
threads=2

[`app`.`users`]
`email`=random_string
